<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS1.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6.1 Illustrative Examples ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ Manipulating Transformer-Based Models:Controllability, Steerability, and Robust Interventions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Branching prompt sequences.</span></a></li>
